%% Title: Effective Execution Config Resolution And Artifact Hashing
%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date    2026-05-12
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   System / Interaction
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.6, §2.8, ADR-025, ADR-044
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI run command
    participant Bootstrap as bootstrap.runtime.assembly
    participant Loader as PipelineConfigLoader
    participant DQ as DQConfigLoader
    participant Filter as FilterConfigLoader
    participant Resolver as domain_config_resolver
    participant Builder as effective_config_artifact_builder
    participant Artifact as EffectiveConfigArtifact
    participant Hashes as EffectiveConfigHashes

    CLI->>Bootstrap: load_pipeline_config(...)
    Bootstrap->>Loader: load pipeline YAML
    Bootstrap->>DQ: load dq policy YAML
    Bootstrap->>Filter: load filter YAML
    Loader-->>Resolver: pipeline config payload
    DQ-->>Resolver: dq policy payload
    Filter-->>Resolver: filter payload
    Bootstrap->>Resolver: collect runtime settings + env
    Resolver-->>Builder: resolved snapshots
    Builder->>Artifact: build artifact payload
    Builder->>Hashes: compute stable hashes
    Hashes-->>Artifact: attach hash set
    Artifact-->>Bootstrap: effective config artifact
    Bootstrap-->>CLI: artifact ref + config identity

    Note over Resolver,Builder: RuntimeOverrideSnapshot and ExecutionEnvironmentSnapshot become durable provenance.
